_civo_trigger, exp_010a_cheetah_baseline_s1, exp_008d_subsample_on_h8 |\\\\n| D065 | 2026-05-16 | D065: exp_018 配置错误确认 — gate_enabled=false 导致 full_ | exp_018_full_sgs_walker_s1, exp_019a_pickcube_baseline, exp_018v2_full_sgs_walker_s1 |\\\\n| D064 | 2026-05-16 | D064: Dream 审稿分析 — 6 项结构性问题确认行动，018 已解决 mitigation | exp_018_full_sgs_walker_s1 |\\\\n| D063 | 2026-05-16 | D063: 018 Full-SGS 确认 Scenario A — CIVO 是 gradient | exp_018_full_sgs_walker_s1, exp_016e_sgs_walker_s1, exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8, exp_008d_subsample_on_h8 |\\\\n| D062 | 2026-05-16 | C2 因果链精化：CIVO trigger 是 trained + exposed 组合，非 tra | exp_008a, exp_008d, exp_015b, exp_008f, exp_006, exp_007 |\\\\n| D061 | 2026-05-15 | D061: 016e reward SGS 是 no-op（reward→dt_emb 梯度=0）。 | 016e, 018 |\\\\n| D060 | 2026-05-15 | D060: cuda:1→Cheetah baseline(010a), cuda:0(009d后) | 010a, 018 |\\\\n| D059 | 2026-05-15 | D059: Framing 选 B（diagnostic + SGS negative），cuda: | 016e, 010a |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4242, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VVjg8XcxFS9zdzgBQKsc21","session_id":"a884cd18-9ddc-4e56-828b-637c4a5e9c11","uuid":"3dac6ed6-67dc-466e-ae5d-26fedefb5e77","timestamp":"2026-05-16T17:56:16.037Z"}
